{"seq":17,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T05:33:06.027Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"246c02c2f424e4c08a8f3642b39c3414357bb23bf0019657d5be679b50bfba90","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests (plus the channel) support:\n• *Vantorre Group:* Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account and changed hands on *2026-05-04* (Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day). Gideon's July 1 post here also calls it \"Nadia's old industrial account\".\n• *Vantorre Mobility:* Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, and the earlier digests call it Gideon's fleet account.\n• *Orlavine Medical Supply:* Gideon Sato, but this one is inferred. The digests only say \"Gideon's medical account\" (12/1/25 and 9/30/26), and the 3/10/25 digest called it Nadia's medical account, so it moved from Nadia to Gideon at some point. I couldn't find a date for that move. OMS is the only medical account named, but check it before it goes on the slide.\n• *Quillfeather Outfitters:* I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the \"pod's outdoor/retail account\", and the 9/30 digest has Nadia hosting a training session for it, which doesn't establish ownership. Please check the CRM.\n\nOne caution for the slide: Moss's cheat sheet still describes Vantorre Group as \"Nadia's industrial account\". That's stale.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T05:33:10.559Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"439e484966f34677698a05d5451715f9dd7426bf1352b4fb4f65f47117ca4f51","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in her #strategic-pod thread. Two of the four owners are firm, one is inferred, and one I couldn't find.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account and changed hands on **2026-05-04**. Moss's 5/3 note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The digests only say \"Gideon's medical account\" (12/1/25 and 9/30/26). The 3/10/25 digest called it Nadia's medical account, so it moved at some point, and I found no date for that. I told Ruth to check it before it goes on the slide.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor or retail account. The 9/30 digest has Nadia hosting a training session for it, which doesn't show she owns it. I suggested Ruth check the CRM.\n\nI also warned Ruth that Moss's cheat sheet still calls Vantorre Group \"Nadia's industrial account\", which is out of date.\n\nI used only the digests and #strategic-pod, which Ruth belongs to, and I didn't search other conversations."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
